=== WEB SOURCE → NATIVE PARITY (no scope narrowing, no parity shortcuts) ===
Web `AITripPostcardShareCardImageGeneration` = `withAiFeature('trip-postcard-share-card-image-generation',
InnerSection)` where InnerSection is an `AIFeatureCard` driven by `useAiStream`. It reads `tripId?:
number` + `styleHint?: string`, computes `numericTripId = (typeof tripId==='number' && isFinite)?tripId:0`,
builds a `useMemo` body `{ trip_id, style_hint? }` (style_hint trimmed, omitted when empty), POSTs it
to the static URL `/ai/share-cards/trip-image/draft`, and gates the button on
`canStart = numericTripId > 0`. Propose-only: Helix drafts an image prompt + preview spec; the existing
per-trip Share button remains the publishing path.

Data sources (P1/S8 state-holders, no direct HTTP from the view):
  - useTranslation → AIPostcardStrings facade (NSLocalizedString, per-surface .strings table).
  - useAiStream    → AIPostcardStreamDriver seam. LiveAIPostcardStreamDriver = real URLSession.bytes SSE
                     consumer POSTing the JSON body to ${base}/api/v1/ai/share-cards/trip-image/draft,
                     routing frames through AIPostcardSseFrameParser + AIPostcardStreamReducer (verbatim
                     ports of the web parseSSEFrame/toTypedEvent + handleEvent). InMemory double for
                     previews/tests.
Shared components mapped:
  - @/components/ai/AIFeatureCard → AIPostcardFeatureCard (TSGlassPanel header + Helix badge + description
    + empty hint + universal "Ask Helix" button + AIPostcardOutputView panel).
  - @/components/ai/withAiFeature → the `.gatedOff` phase collapses the surface to EmptyView (ADR-015
    AI-Off contract: no AI surface leaks when the feature flag is off).
Charts/maps: none in the web source → none added.
States rendered (every one, never a blank box): gatedOff, loading (skeleton chrome), idle (friendly
  prompt), thinking (Helix thinking indicator), draft (streamed image prompt + preview spec), error
  (QueryError peer + Retry); plus the orthogonal P4 connectivity axis stale/offline (freshness chip +
  one-shot auto-refresh; offline keeps the cached draft and disables Generate).
